DejaVu Fonts
============

The files DejaVuSans.ttf and DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf in this directory are
redistributed unmodified from the DejaVu Fonts project.

    Source:  https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/
    Version: 2.37

They are bundled with fool-bot so that board images render identically on
every host. Looking fonts up by bare filename cannot work across platforms,
because macOS, Windows and Linux each file the same typeface under a
different name. See d12ball/render.py.

Fonts are (c) 2003 by Bitstream, Inc. All Rights Reserved.
Bitstream Vera is a trademark of Bitstream, Inc.
DejaVu changes are in public domain.


