Racing Sans One
===============

The file RacingSansOne-Regular.ttf is redistributed unmodified from the
Racing Sans One project.

    Source:  https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/racingsansone
    Version: 1.001 (2012)

Bundled for the same reason as DejaVu above -- see d12ball/render.py -- and
used for the goal zone's own lettering. Licensed under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1; the full text is in RacingSansOne-OFL.txt in this
directory. Copyright (c) 2012, Pablo Impallari (www.impallari.com) and
Rodrigo Fuenzalida (www.rfuenzalida.com), with Reserved Font Name Racing
Sans.
